This product is an Apache-2.0 derivative rewrite of selected
implementation patterns from:

  macOS-vz-kubelet
  Copyright 2024 Agoda Company Pte. Ltd.
  https://github.com/agoda-com/macOS-vz-kubelet
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

It is not a fork of that tree. The guest agent, fail-closed 2-VM
admission, probes, and TLS-required kubelet HTTP server are original.
Some algorithms and on-disk formats were adapted from Agoda; those
source files carry a "Derived from Agoda macOS-vz-kubelet (Apache-2.0)"
comment. Adapted areas include:

  - Virtualization.framework device wiring (bootloader, platform, NAT/bridged
    networking, virtio-fs shared directories, Mac graphics device)
  - APFS clonefile copy-on-write overlays for VM disks
  - Hybrid pod model (container[0] = macOS VM, containers[1..] = host sidecars)
  - OCI artifact layout for macOS disk + auxiliary storage (Agoda media
    types accepted on read)
  - Virtual Kubelet provider surface (Create/Delete/Get/Exec/Logs/Stats)
  - Sparse disk writes, ARP MAC lookup, MAC normalization, Apple CPU
    model label sanitizing

Files with an explicit derived-from comment include:

  internal/disk/sparse.go
  internal/netutil/mac.go
  internal/netutil/arp.go
  internal/labels/cpu.go
  pkg/runtime/vz/vz.go
  pkg/runtime/vz/platform.go
  pkg/image/config.go
  pkg/image/overlay.go

